Cyclades Cyclom-Y Serial Driver v1.0.0
=======================================
WDM kernel driver for CD1400 UART.
ISA + PCI. Win2K-Win11 + DOS.
7 binaries. 0 warnings. GPLv3.

i386\   Win32 driver + tools (PE32)
x64\    Win64 driver (build with WDK)
DOS\    Hardware detect, FOSSIL test
DOC\    10 documents, 2300+ lines
SOURCE\ Complete GPLv3 source

AUTHORS: evga + hexadecimal + wrench
